Here I still agree with Derek; you can't make them make the mistakes you
want them to. Serial ascenders aren't going to step off of Elbereth while
fighting Demogorgon. Serial ascenders _are_ going to walk into floating
eyes. (Hi Mike! Don't feel bad, my longest streak ended that way too.)

